     Does this happen when entering that particular level for the first
time (for that current game), or when returning to a previously visited
level?  If the former, then it sounds like there's a problem with "bones"
files (data left behind by some other killed character), which have a
chance of being reused instead of a fresh level when another character
reaches there.

     There is a known VMS-specific problem (present in 3.1.1, but not
discovered until after patch 2 was prepared for release) when such levels
have double-digit numbers.  However, that particular problem affects
only VMS because of some port-specific filename manipulation and wouldn't
matter for PCs.

     If you have 3.1.0, you should update to at least 3.1.1, and 3.1.2
will be available within a matter of days.



